{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the most skilled opponents in completely crazy tennis matches. Play on the most unusual courts, from the bottom of the sea to the top of the clouds. Compete in tournaments in Single Player and 2-player Co-op campaigns, or invite your friends to friendly matches for up to 4 players. Defeat giant monsters using your racket and ask yourself, &quot;Why am I facing a giant robot in a tennis match?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/9751efcb69a0eef45b7ec1ece7a4eecd.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/6e5b499597b43d46451e66ee9d040f82.poster.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/6e5b499597b43d46451e66ee9d040f82.webm?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/6e5b499597b43d46451e66ee9d040f82.mp4?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of characters to choose from, each one weirder than the other! Each has unique skills and attributes, suited to different types of strategy. Choose the one that best suits your style or the one you think has the funniest face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f75f2b6099f380307696b0e046d54dbb.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/663d194e2ea87178f5413c4e177f9a44.poster.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/663d194e2ea87178f5413c4e177f9a44.webm?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/663d194e2ea87178f5413c4e177f9a44.mp4?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful where you walk, the path to becoming the best is full of obstacles! Each court has dangers that make the matches unique. Someone thought it would be a good idea to play tennis on quicksand, so don't think your opponents will be your only challenge on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/72f10cd0e3dbf3d4387b67235f558fdf.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f56ba333bc0bff565dbe62adac5ad133.poster.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f56ba333bc0bff565dbe62adac5ad133.webm?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f56ba333bc0bff565dbe62adac5ad133.mp4?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise your opponents with special abilities. Fireballs, sticky bubbles, and super-strong shots are just some of the powers you'll have to face. Each character has a unique ability, so be prepared for all kinds of amazing techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/41b194acfd94cd2b674cce254541fbe1.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/4c5f892aad37bb61a4675f0930ca0462.poster.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/4c5f892aad37bb61a4675f0930ca0462.webm?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/4c5f892aad37bb61a4675f0930ca0462.mp4?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the most terrifying beasts with the power of your racket! Tennis is an unpredictable sport, and we never know when a giant monster will invade the court. Grab your racket and your courage and defeat these great enemies so that peace can be maintained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Too lazy to read and just looking for a feature list? Here\u2019s everything you\u2019ll find in Quacol\u00e9 Tennis:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 characters with unique attributes and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different courts, each with its own obstacles and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 and 2v2 tennis matches (or 2v1 as well, life\u2019s not fair, so why should this game be?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player and Co-op campaigns for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles (is this still a tennis game?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your racket and call your friends for the greatest adventure in the world of tennis!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406330?t=1767997170","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767997170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/b5862c11990c6c69ec8adad04ed75608d38de3fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767997170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/b5862c11990c6c69ec8adad04ed75608d38de3fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767997170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3420640,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against the most skilled opponents in completely crazy tennis matches. Play on the most unusual courts, from the bottom of the sea to the top of the clouds. Compete in tournaments in Single Player and 2-player Co-op campaigns, or invite your friends to friendly matches for up to 4 players. Defeat giant monsters using your racket and ask yourself, &quot;Why am I facing a giant robot in a tennis match?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/9751efcb69a0eef45b7ec1ece7a4eecd.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/6e5b499597b43d46451e66ee9d040f82.poster.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/6e5b499597b43d46451e66ee9d040f82.webm?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/6e5b499597b43d46451e66ee9d040f82.mp4?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of characters to choose from, each one weirder than the other! Each has unique skills and attributes, suited to different types of strategy. Choose the one that best suits your style or the one you think has the funniest face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f75f2b6099f380307696b0e046d54dbb.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/663d194e2ea87178f5413c4e177f9a44.poster.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/663d194e2ea87178f5413c4e177f9a44.webm?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/663d194e2ea87178f5413c4e177f9a44.mp4?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful where you walk, the path to becoming the best is full of obstacles! Each court has dangers that make the matches unique. Someone thought it would be a good idea to play tennis on quicksand, so don't think your opponents will be your only challenge on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/72f10cd0e3dbf3d4387b67235f558fdf.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f56ba333bc0bff565dbe62adac5ad133.poster.avif?t=1767997170\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f56ba333bc0bff565dbe62adac5ad133.webm?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406330/extras/f56ba333bc0bff565dbe62adac5ad133.mp4?t=1767997170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise your opponents with special abilities. Fireballs, sticky bubbles, and super-strong shots are just some of the powers you'll have to face. Each character has a unique ability, so be prepared for all kinds of amazing techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_c